Expose the com-api-example binary and its mw_com config to the reference
integration showcase bundle. Upstream dropped the public visibility on the
rust_binary, and the config file was never exported. The visibility guard golden
lists the now-public binary.

diff --git a/quality/visibility_guard/public_targets.golden b/quality/visibility_guard/public_targets.golden
index a4c73472..c474a1b8 100644
--- a/quality/visibility_guard/public_targets.golden
+++ b/quality/visibility_guard/public_targets.golden
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@
 //score/mw/com/dependability:mw_com_doc_needs
 //score/mw/com/dependability:mw_com_index
 //score/mw/com/dependability:mw_com_rst
+//score/mw/com/example/com-api-example:com-api-example
 //score/mw/com/impl/configuration/converter:json_to_flatbuffer_rule.bzl
 //score/mw/com/performance_benchmarks/macro_benchmark/config_generator:config_generator_rule.bzl
 //score/mw/com/performance_benchmarks/macro_benchmark:logging.json
diff --git a/score/mw/com/example/com-api-example/BUILD b/score/mw/com/example/com-api-example/BUILD
index 83448e5e..99ed378f 100644
--- a/score/mw/com/example/com-api-example/BUILD
+++ b/score/mw/com/example/com-api-example/BUILD
@@ -13,6 +13,8 @@
 
